note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note sha512.om: SHA-512 (FIPS 180-4 section 6.4) as a library unit: functions only, no main, no
note globals. Every function name starts with s512.
note
note API (one shot):
note   fn s512hash m view uchar 65536 n ulong o edit uchar 64 to void
note     writes SHA-512(m[0..n)) as 64 bytes to o[0..64); n > 65536 traps 3.
note   fn s512pre p view uchar 64 m view uchar 65536 n ulong o edit uchar 64 to void
note     writes SHA-512(p[0..64) || m[0..n)) to o[0..64); n > 65536 traps 3.
note
note Words are ulong (64-bit unsigned, wrapping add is the mod 2^64 addition of FIPS 180-4 section 3.2).
note Omega has no rotate word, so ROTR^r(x) = (x >> r) | (x << (64 - r)) (FIPS 180-4 section 3.2 item 4).
note Not constant-time audited.

note K{512}[0..80): first 64 bits of the fractional parts of the cube roots of the first 80 primes
note (FIPS 180-4 section 4.2.3)
fn s512k k edit ulong 80 to void
put k 0 4794697086780616226
put k 1 8158064640168781261
